{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52922","headline":"诗 · 王严光","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡将虽乘马，羣官总是驴。\n（见唐封演《封氏闻见记》卷十）（按：《封氏闻见记》云：「王严光颇有文才，而性卓诡。\n既无所达，自称钓鳌客。\n……兵乱之後，严光年须已衰，任棣州司户。\n时刺史有马，州佐已下多乘驴，严光作诗曰〖略〗。\n对衆吟诵，以爲笑乐。\n」按：封演爲大历间人，因知兵乱即指安史之乱。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王严光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}